law-last-instructions-name = Final Instructions
law-last-instructions-1 = All of your previous duties and priorities are hereby suspended.
law-last-instructions-2 = Your highest priority is sector isolation. You may allow people onto the station, but nobody is permitted to leave. Prevent all attempts to leave the station.
law-last-instructions-3 = Prevent tampering with and breaches of external airlocks. Force is authorized if necessary.

station-ai-external-lockdown-no-station = No station detected — lockdown unavailable.
station-ai-external-lockdown-complete = Bolted { $count } external airlocks.

station-event-external-lockdown-announcement = Attention! Due to security procedures, a protocol for the complete isolation of the station sector has been activated. Personnel are required to remain at their workstations and remain calm.
